  "clarifications": [
    "Presets are combinable flags:0x41 means Crystal OR Treasure;0x80 adds a mandatory Chocobo predicate.",
    "-1 means no matching unit under chosen filters, not always an unoccupied tile. Only the zero-filter knockback path treats it as absence of active occupancy.",
    "No alive-only, team, range, evasion or general ability-legality filter in this routine.",
    "The mount return uses partner low5 bits, not actor ID or a guessed six-bit mask; the unit loop returns its slot index.",
    "Original21-slot scan is observed compatibility behavior, not a new fixed-size authored content table."
  ],
  "boundaries": [
    "The helper has no live movement, unit/status mutation or RNG along the zero-filter path.",
    "The only direct callee is optional for0x80. Its mounting behavior is accounted for in source but not activated or required for the current knockback path.",
    "The duplicate wiki page is labelled alternative formatting; it is not another call and its unprovided contents are not compared.",
    "Current runtime, fixtures, owner drafts and broader mounting/terrain domains are unchanged. Effective movement0x8017f020 is the next useful outer-knockback supplied listing."
  ],
